            "notes": "Get [De Kuiper's Thesis](item_d2ca1240-ec35-48c0-bc19-f6376af032b4). This is where you'll start to play around your shield. Beyond just shielding your team from damage, the shield is a really good way to split up the objective. For example, on Illios, when everyone's contesting point, I like to place my shield in the middle and play around it. I'll move between the shield, around the shield, or just anywhere near my shield. The harder you are to kill, the more space you give your dps to make picks.\n\nIf you're playing with dive heroes, you can send your shield with them to provide some healing (if they're within line of sight).\n\nIf you don't have enough cash, then get [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) + [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) if most of the enemy is running ability power, or [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09)+ [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) if they're running weapon power.",
