            "notes": "My power R7 tends to cycle depending on the team or who I'm against. \n\nGet [Event Horizon](item_01720c0d-74a0-4c6a-8f75-c9e1fe908186) if you didn't do so in R5.\n\nBut if you did:\n\n[Singularity](item_d5c3fffb-e066-4078-a4e5-a5ab383856f4) is great for more cc.\n\n[Hyperloop](item_aea2ba3d-76a7-44f1-b12f-88a04f4d68bb) lets you spam more rocks if you're really nailing each one.\n\n[Trinisphere](item_ffaf0527-137c-4fa6-8048-82f2c99f6d56) if your feeling a little ambitious and want more power. (This is the one I tend to take to help with poke)\n\n[Antimatter](item_80887501-7855-40af-ab3c-c8c13a259e95) is what I would get to buff my primary attack. But, if you find yourself building ult really early in the round then [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is crazy strong (but most times I'm simply a meat shield for my team).",
